  "proven_inactive_reasons": {
    "fonts": "Complete original native source contains no test_fonts caller beyond DEPS and no Skia/test-font GN/C++ target. In pinned testing/test.gni, mac follows the non-Android/non-Fuchsia/non-ChromeOS-device/non-iOS branch; the Fuchsia component test_fonts shard is not selected. Mac rtc_test delegates ordinary test(), generated wrapper only writes checked-in script text, and direct native12 filters do not invoke a font-data route.",
    "format": "Original buildtools DEPS Mac/mac_arm64 formatting object is selected, but complete pinned buildtools and native/build/testing GN/action sources contain no clang-format execution target. The fixed recipe runs direct GN/Ninja, native12, archives and license generation; no format/presubmit/sync/hooks command.",
    "luci": "Selected packages are CAS/isolate/swarming. Complete native/build/testing GN has no action consuming tools/luci-go. The concrete base_test_triggerer.py path is an infra/Swarming entry, outside fixed production targets and ordinary Mac rtc_test generated wrapper DATA. Fixed native12 and license commands do not invoke it.",
    "reclient": "Pinned build/toolchain/rbe.gni declares use_remoteexec=false and use_reclient=use_remoteexec && !use_siso. Fixed args preserve build_with_chromium=false and use_siso=false and do not override remoteexec. Actual Mac toolchain supplies only current_cpu and no true remoteexec/reclient override. apple/toolchain.gni prepends rewrapper only when toolchain_uses_reclient. No reclient client/config execution is selected.",
    "resultdb": "Selected package is result_adapter. Ordinary Mac rtc_test wrapper/test_scripts_shared includes checked-in build/util proto/test_results Python DATA, not this binary. Wrapper generation writes text; fixed builder directly lists/runs rtc_unittests with exact filter/XML, never bot/ResultDB adapter/infra runner. No native/build/testing GN action executes this package.",
    "siso": "Native .gn defaults use_siso=true, but the unchanged fixed args explicitly override use_siso=false in both GN outputs. Pinned build/toolchain/siso.gni documents this variable as autoninja dispatch/reclient default. The recipe invokes the genuine pinned Ninja directly, never autoninja/siso; no Siso runtime or remote backend selected."
  },
